  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文化史專題",
    "sub_ename": "TOPICS ON CULTURAL HISTORY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生以多元視角觀察文化現象的能力。主題涵蓋：神話傳說與歷史紀錄、地理空間與旅遊書寫、城市文化與常民消費、疾病與醫療、身體與性別、禮教與行為科學、圖像與視覺文化、閱讀與出版文化。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to cultivate students' ability to observe cultural phenomena from multiple perspectives. Topics include: mythology and historical records, geographical space and tourism writing, urban culture and ordinary consumption, disease and medical care, body and gender, ethics and behavioral science, image and visual culture, reading and publishing culture.",
